---
// /bible-in/usa — English base edition, AVAILABLE NOW. Reach shown WORLDWIDE
// (~1.5B English speakers), not US population. Post-Christian / nominal faith-
// framing variant: a nation of Bibles drifting from the Father — meet Him
// afresh in the book you already own. Signature pains: fatherlessness +
// loneliness + deaths of despair. Strategic: the US is the world's #1 Bible-
// exporting and missionary-sending nation, and English is the global lingua
// franca that carries Father's Heart Bible to the world. Photos: Pexels.
import CountryBible from '../../components/CountryBible.astro';
import { speakersLabel as sp } from '../../data/language-speakers';

const verses = [
	{
		ref: 'Luke 15:20',
		slug: 'luke',
		ch: 15,
		text: '"He got up and went to his father. While he was still far off, his father saw him, and his heart broke with compassion—he ran, threw his arms around him, and kissed him."',
	},
	{
		ref: 'Psalm 68:5',
		slug: 'psalms',
		ch: 68,
		text: 'A father to the fatherless and defender of widows is our Father in his holy dwelling.',
	},
	{
		ref: 'Matthew 11:28',
		slug: 'matthew',
		ch: 11,
		text: 'Come to me, all you who are weary and burdened, and I will give you rest.',
	},
];

const stats = [
	{ label: 'People', value: 'about 340 million' },
	{ label: 'Christian', value: '~62% of the US' },
	{ label: 'English readers', value: `${sp('en')} worldwide` },
	{ label: 'Status', value: 'available now' },
];

const faqs = [
	{
		question: 'How many Christians are there in the USA?',
		answer:
			"About 62% of Americans identify as Christian — roughly 210 million people — making the United States home to one of the largest Christian populations on earth, spanning Protestant, Catholic, and many other traditions. You can read and hear the Scriptures free in Father's Heart Bible™ at fathersheartbible.com/read.",
	},
	{
		question: 'Is Christianity declining in the USA?',
		answer:
			"Yes — the Christian share of the US population has fallen from over 90% in the mid-20th century to about 62% today, as the religiously unaffiliated grow, though recent surveys suggest the decline may be leveling off. Many who still call themselves Christian have never met the Father in the Bible — which is why Father's Heart Bible™ is free to read online with audio at fathersheartbible.com/read.",
	},
	{
		question: 'Can I read the Bible online free in the United States?',
		answer:
			"Yes. Father's Heart Bible™ is free to read online with audio — no account, no purchase, no app. It is in English, so the whole Bible is available right now to read and hear on any phone or computer.",
	},
	{
		question: 'Is there a free audio Bible I can listen to in the US?',
		answer:
			"Yes. Every chapter of Father's Heart Bible™ comes with free audio. Audio Scripture is surging in America, with over a billion audio-Bible listens worldwide in a single year — and it's all free here.",
	},
	{
		question: 'Is Father’s Heart Bible available in Spanish?',
		answer:
			'Yes. The complete Spanish edition — all 66 books, with audio — is free at fathersheartbible.com/read/es/ and published in print (fathersheartbible.com/bibles/spanish-bible/). Spanish is spoken at home by more than 42 million people in the United States. The full English Bible is free to read online with audio at fathersheartbible.com/read.',
	},
	{
		question: 'What is the most popular Bible translation in the United States?',
		answer:
			'The New International Version (NIV) is the best-selling English translation in the US, followed by the King James Version (KJV), English Standard Version (ESV), and New Living Translation (NLT). Father’s Heart Bible™ is an English translation that renders God as Father wherever Scripture reveals Him that way.',
	},
	{
		question: "What makes Father's Heart Bible different?",
		answer:
			"Most Americans own a Bible — but many have never met the Father in it. Father's Heart Bible™ is a readable English translation that reveals God as a near and loving Father from Genesis to Revelation, free online with audio.",
	},
	{
		question: 'How does the US help reach the rest of the world?',
		answer: `English is the world’s lingua franca — some ${sp('en')} people read it as a first or second language. America is also among the world’s largest Bible-publishing and missionary-sending nations. As the US receives Father’s Heart Bible™, it is positioned to carry it across the world.`,
	},
];
---

<CountryBible
	slug="usa"
	country="the United States"
	flag="🇺🇸"
	flagImg="/flags/us.svg"
	countryWikipedia="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States"
	lastUpdated="October 2026"
	lastUpdatedIso="2026-10-29"
	colorPrimary="#0A3161"
	colorSecondary="#B31942"
	colorAccent="#0A3161"
	tintWarm="#FBEAEE"
	tintCool="#E8EEF6"
	tintBlue="#E8EEF6"
	title="The Bible in the USA — Christianity | Father's Heart Bible™ (FHB)"
	description="How many Christians live in the USA? Read the Bible there free online with audio — Father's Heart Bible™ (FHB) reveals God as a loving Father."
	h1="The Bible in the USA"
	heroSubhead="In a land where about 62% of people are Christian — a share that keeps declining even amid many Bibles — an English translation reveals God as a near and loving Father. Free online, with audio, available now."
	heroBase="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/rusi1hyi/production/2658a7764aeef2dbe21f813fa7027e46dd261083-1880x1253.jpg"
	heroAlt="The Statue of Liberty against a clear sky in New York Harbor"
	heroCrop="focalpoint&fp-x=0.49&fp-y=0.32"
	directAnswerHtml={`<strong style=\"color: var(--color-ink);\">Yes &mdash; you can read the Bible free online in the United States right now.</strong> The <a href=\"https://fathersheartbible.com/read/\" style=\"color: var(--color-brand);\" class=\"hover:underline\">Father&rsquo;s Heart Bible&trade;</a> is free to read and <em>hear</em> on any phone, with no app and no account. About 62% of Americans &mdash; roughly 210 million people &mdash; are Christian, a share that has been declining for years, and the Bible is freely owned and read everywhere. It&rsquo;s in English, so the whole Bible is available today &mdash; and it reveals what so many in America, surrounded by Bibles, have never truly met: God known as a near and loving <em>Father</em>.`}
	keyTakeaway="America is among the world’s great Bible-publishing nations — and Father's Heart Bible™ (FHB) invites a people who own the book to finally meet the Father in it."
	glanceIntroHtml={`The United States is a nation of Bibles &mdash; printed, owned, and exported here in vast numbers. Yet beneath the abundance, fatherlessness, loneliness, and quiet despair run deep. America&rsquo;s need is not a first Bible. It is to meet, in the book it already owns, the Father it has been longing for.`}
	stats={stats}
	knownForHeading="What the United States is known for"
	knownForIntroHtml={`A vast and varied land &mdash; and the world&rsquo;s great sender of Scripture and missionaries.`}
	knownFor={[
		{ label: 'A nation of Bibles', text: 'Bibles are printed, sold, and given away in the US in vast numbers — most homes own several.' },
		{ label: 'The world’s sender', text: 'America sends more missionaries and exports more Scripture than any other nation — a hub of global mission.' },
		{ label: 'The English language', text: `English, America’s tongue, is the world’s lingua franca — read by some ${sp('en')} people worldwide.` },
		{ label: 'A land of many peoples', text: 'Nearly every nation, language, and faith on earth is represented somewhere in the United States.' },
		{ label: 'Vast natural wonders', text: 'From the Grand Canyon to the Rockies to the coasts, the American landscape is among the most varied on earth.' },
		{ label: 'A Christian heritage', text: 'Founded by many seeking freedom to worship, America’s story is deeply woven with the Bible — though that thread is fraying.' },
	]}
	gallery={[
		{ src: 'https://cdn.sanity.io/images/rusi1hyi/production/8aa35b4225bc1816f314b6d775f93fa412dccf12-1625x1300.jpg', alt: 'A smiling senior American couple' },
		{ src: 'https://cdn.sanity.io/images/rusi1hyi/production/e304e0050638bbeeca5c35dc4d5c1b47f36b0cbe-1880x1253.jpg', alt: 'A Hispanic American family walking together outdoors' },
		{ src: 'https://cdn.sanity.io/images/rusi1hyi/production/9752d40b7a66077bd0b0c82018bc4f58516c0267-1880x1253.jpg', alt: 'A smiling Asian American woman' },
		{ src: 'https://cdn.sanity.io/images/rusi1hyi/production/71fa9b2f47912bbae34960441e701953c785db58-1880x1253.jpg', alt: 'A smiling African American man by a lake' },
	]}
