		{ label: 'Fatherlessness statistics — US Census / NFI', url: 'https://www.fatherhood.org/father-absence-statistic' },
		{ label: 'Our Epidemic of Loneliness — US Surgeon General', url: 'https://www.hhs.gov/surgeongeneral/priorities/connection/index.html' },
		{ label: 'Census Bureau living-arrangements data on children without a father, 2023 (NIUSSP analysis)', url: 'https://www.niussp.org/family-and-households/americas-single-parent-households-and-missing-fathers/' },
		{ label: 'CDC NCHS, U.S. overdose deaths decrease almost 27% in 2024 (80,391)', url: 'https://cdc.gov/nchs/pressroom/releases/20250514.html' },
	]}
	faithsHeading="What “our Father” offers America"
	faithsIntroHtml={`America has Bibles to spare. Father&rsquo;s Heart Bible&trade; does not bring a new religion &mdash; it answers the ache beneath the abundance: to be held by a Father who never abandons His children. In readable English, Scripture reveals God not as a distant idea, but as a <em>Father</em> who runs to meet His child.`}
	faithsBlocks={[
		{ heading: 'For the fatherless', bodyHtml: `To a generation growing up without a father, Scripture promises <a href="https://fathersheartbible.com/read/psalms/68/" style="color: var(--color-gold);" class="hover:underline">&ldquo;a father to the fatherless&rdquo;</a> &mdash; a Father who is near to the child no one came home for.` },
		{ heading: 'For the lonely and the weary', bodyHtml: `Into an epidemic of loneliness, the Father says, <a href="https://fathersheartbible.com/read/matthew/11/" style="color: var(--color-gold);" class="hover:underline">&ldquo;Come to me, all you who are weary&hellip; and I will give you rest.&rdquo;</a>` },
		{ heading: 'For the one who has wandered', bodyHtml: `To everyone who has drifted from faith, Father&rsquo;s Heart Bible&trade; reveals <a href="https://fathersheartbible.com/read/luke/15/" style="color: var(--color-gold);" class="hover:underline">the Father who runs to meet His returning child</a> &mdash; no shame, only welcome.` },
		{ heading: 'For the one who owns a Bible but not the Father', bodyHtml: `Where God has become a distant idea, Father&rsquo;s Heart Bible&trade; reveals Him as He truly is &mdash; a Father near, in the very book already on the shelf.` },
	]}
	whyHeading="Why Father's Heart Bible™ for America"
	whyBlocks={[
		{ heading: 'God revealed as Father, in plain English', bodyHtml: `In a land of many translations, Father&rsquo;s Heart Bible&trade; reveals God as <em>Father</em> wherever Scripture reveals Him that way &mdash; from <a href="https://fathersheartbible.com/read/genesis/1/" style="color: var(--color-brand);" class="hover:underline">Genesis 1:1</a> onward &mdash; in readable English.` },
		{ heading: 'Free, with audio, on any phone', bodyHtml: `No purchase, no app, no sign-up. The whole Bible is free to <a href="https://fathersheartbible.com/read/" style="color: var(--color-brand);" class="hover:underline">read online</a> with audio on every chapter &mdash; ready for a distracted, hurried nation.` },
