	wordHeading="His Word will not return void"
	wordBodyHtml={`<p>When our Father said, &ldquo;Let there be light,&rdquo; there was light. His Word accomplishes what He sends it to do. Into every American home full of Bibles and empty of the Father&rsquo;s nearness, His Word will not return empty &mdash; it will find the fatherless and the weary, and it will not fail.</p><p class="mt-4" style="color: var(--color-ink);">&ldquo;&hellip;so will my word be that goes out from my mouth: it will not return to me empty, but will accomplish what I desire and achieve the purpose for which I sent it.&rdquo; <span style="color: var(--color-muted);">&mdash; Isaiah 55:11</span></p>`}
