	]}
	opportunityHeading="Reach and the open doors in America"
	opportunityIntroHtml={`English is live today and already reaches some ${sp('en')} people worldwide, and the complete Spanish edition is published &mdash; while other communities within America, the Deaf and the Native nations, still wait for the Father&rsquo;s voice in their own tongue.`}
